      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T17:40:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can make a workqueue to call __add_ino_entry() out of f2fs_evict_inode() context. Then, f2fs_iget() needs to wait for workqueue job.",
      "revId": "847a6bbc0c821412255b5b6dce6d9954e67a7766",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
